        "MX_GPIO_Init enables the port clock in RCC then writes MODER/OTYPER/OSPEEDR/PUPDR; HAL_GPIO_WritePin is one store to BSRR, atomic.",
        "SystemClock_Config: HSI 16 / M × N / P with the VCO ranges, flash wait states before the switch, SysTick for 1 ms.",
