        "Reads a part number: series, line and core, pin count, flash size, package, temperature grade; checks the alternate-function table for pin conflicts.",
        "Selection by six questions: peripherals and pins, memory with margin, performance, power, toolchain and ecosystem, lifecycle and price.",
        "Knows M4F means single-precision FPU and DSP instructions; names the datasheet, reference manual, errata and programming manual.",
